	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/video_settings/prism/rebaked/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Game Shaders: the baked light takes the game's light's place under its own textures, highlights and reflections. PRISM Materials: every surface lit by PRISM's materials alone (darker where the game's reflections lit it)."/>
		<string text="How characters, vehicles and weapons are lit. Baked: by the baked light where they are. Never Darker: the baked light, but never darker than Classic lit them."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The sun's shadows of vehicles, characters and weapons. Traced: ray traced, on the ground, on each other and on themselves. Classic's: the game's own, on the ground only."/>
		<string text="How sharp the game's own object shadows are, which PRISM Rebaked draws while Object Shadows are Classic's."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Enhanced: plasma bolts and needles light their surroundings too, each with a glow, and a muzzle flash lights your own weapon. Classic: only the lights the Xbox had.|Classic for everyone in a Pro 2v2 game; yours again after it."/>
	</strings>
</menus>
